(MIT License, with a wish)

Copyright (c) 2026 rrambaldi

This software rests on tools, languages and ideas that I did not make
and could not repay. Almost all of it was a gift. So this is given
freely too, and comes with a wish rather than a price.

Notice, on waking, that you are still here, and that you have been
breathing all night without supervising it. This was never guaranteed
and will not always be the case. Today it happens to be. Be grateful.

In between, practice random kindness and senseless acts of beauty, as
Anne Herbert put it — help without being asked, listen as if nothing
else existed, make something lovely that serves no purpose whatsoever.
Especially that last one. Usefulness is overrated and this software is
already handling it.

Nothing here is a condition. It is a wish, and it is not enforceable,
which is the only honest way to wish for anything.

